          "en": "Article 27\nFurther regulation of the fulfilment of tax obligations as referred to in Article 21, Article 23 and Article 25 shall be determined by a Government Regulation.\nCHAPTER VI\nTAX CREDIT, SETTLEMENT OF TAX UNDERPAYMENT, ANNUAL TAX RETURNS, AND REFUND OF TAX OVERPAYMENT"
