          "en": "Article 21;\nb. who obtain net income not exceeding the amount of non-taxable income as referred to in Article 7.\n(4) The amount of tax payable according to the Annual Tax Return submitted by the taxpayer is the amount of tax payable under this Law.\n(5) If the Director General of Taxes obtains evidence that the amount of tax payable according to the Annual Tax Return is incorrect, the Director General of Taxes shall determine the amount of tax that should be payable."
