          "en": "Article 31\n(1) If the tax payable for a tax year is less than the amount of tax credits as referred to in Article 28, the tax overpayment shall be refunded or credited against other tax debts.\n(2) Before …\n(2) Before the refund or crediting of the tax overpayment as referred to in paragraph (1) is made, the Director General of Taxes is authorised to conduct an examination of the Financial Statements, books and other records, as well as of other matters deemed necessary to determine the amount of tax payable in accordance with the provisions of this Law.\nCHAPTER VII\nOTHER PROVISIONS"
