          "en": "Article 15\nThe provision in this Article regulates the Special Computation Norm for certain groups of taxpayers based on a Decision of the Minister of Finance.\nIn practice, difficulties are often encountered in calculating the amount of income and taxable income for certain groups of taxpayers, so that based on practical considerations, by this Law, the Minister of Finance is given the authority to issue a Decision to determine a Special Computation Norm for calculating the amount of net income, which will naturally become the basis for calculating taxable income for those certain groups of taxpayers."
