          "en": "Article 113\nEvery company that has met the criteria as a Public Company as provided for in this Law and has not submitted a Registration Statement to Bapepam up to the date of promulgation of this Law shall comply with the provisions of this Law no later than 2 (two) years after the promulgation of this Law."
